      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING VIOLET (3) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, paving the way for a 6 length win at this track over 365m in 20.47. Great chance to get the job done again. NATURAL SPARK (1) finished in the minors last time but only a few starts back broke the clock when winning over 365m at this track, taking a Grade 5 in a head turning 20.55. Smart winner three back and looks a key chance on that form. SUMMER ANGEL (2) recorded a NG win two back then missed the frame last time at Wentworth Park, but drawn Box 2 this time where she has won before. Can find the frame this time. FREDDY LIVE WIRE (7) can fill a top-three spot.",
